&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 150.6px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;非監査業務に基づく報酬&lt;/span&gt;
